# Ertai Resurrected, second mode: if its target is no longer legal when the trigger resolves, the trigger does nothing
# (CR 608.2b) - and nobody draws, because "its controller draws" belongs to what was destroyed. In response to the
# trigger aimed at Bot2's Ornithopter, Bot1 Lightning Bolts it itself (paid with the Mox Ruby). Bot2's hand holds the seven
# cards it had after casting the Ornithopter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Ertai Resurrected
Island x2
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Plains x6
Plains x12

